c-qr" alt="QR Code"><p class="small text-muted mt-1 mb-0 fw-bold">Scan to Share</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-7 mb-3"><h6 class="fw-bold text_blue">About the Tree</h6><p class="small text-muted">Found widely in cultivation as a fast-growing avenue tree. Its broad canopy provides immense shade, and the pods and leaves are a favourite food for cattle in India.</p><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/osrhrx9op54V2LgW8?g_st=iw" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary rounded-pill mt-3 w-100"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill me-1"></i> View on Campus Map</a></div></div></div></div></div></div>
