nter shadow-sm w-100 mt-2"><img data-tree="17" class="img-fluid dynamic-qr" alt="QR Code"><p class="small text-muted mt-1 mb-0 fw-bold">Scan to Share</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-7 mb-3"><h6 class="fw-bold text_blue">About the Tree</h6><p class="small text-muted">A perennial tree with its branches arranged in whorls of horizontal tiers. Deep taproot system. Often referred to simply as the "Christmas tree" in the region due to its shape.</p><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/mxtKMzsVuvByQxb27" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary rounded-pill mt-3 w-100"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill me-1"></i> View on Campus Map</a></div></div></div></div></div></div>
