r shadow-sm w-100 mt-2"><img data-tree="19" class="img-fluid dynamic-qr" alt="QR Code"><p class="small text-muted mt-1 mb-0 fw-bold">Scan to Share</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-7 mb-3"><h6 class="fw-bold text_blue">About the Tree</h6><p class="small text-muted">The flowers bloom at night and shed early in the morning. The bark is used as an inferior substitute for cork. Leaf extracts are used to treat sinus issues and skin disorders, displaying antimicrobial properties.</p><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/iwwJAHGtyL5YQ38G7" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary rounded-pill mt-3 w-100"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill me-1"></i> View on Campus Map</a></div></div></div></div></div></div>
